    <div class="ln-faq-list">
      <div class="ln-acc"><div class="ln-acc-hd" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">Is Lunessa safe?</div><div class="ln-acc-body"><div class="ln-acc-inner">Red yeast rice has been used for over 1,000 years and studied extensively in modern research. At our 2,400mg clinical dose it is generally well-tolerated. Unlike a statin taken alone, Lunessa includes 200mg of CoQ10 to replenish what gets depleted — that's the combination that matters. Every batch is third-party tested and certified citrinin-free. Consult your physician if you have liver conditions or are currently on cholesterol medication.</div></div></div>
      <div class="ln-acc"><div class="ln-acc-hd" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">Can I take this with my current medications?</div><div class="ln-acc-body"><div class="ln-acc-inner">Red yeast rice works through a similar mechanism as prescription statins and should NOT be combined with prescription statins without physician supervision. If you take blood thinners, immunosuppressants, or have a complex medication regimen, talk to your doctor first. If you're looking to transition away from statins, work with your physician to create a plan.</div></div></div>
      <div class="ln-acc"><div class="ln-acc-hd" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">How long until I see results?</div><div class="ln-acc-body"><div class="ln-acc-inner">Most people notice improved energy within 1–2 weeks as CoQ10 replenishes. Measurable cholesterol improvements typically appear by month 2–3. We recommend a minimum 90-day commitment — which is why we back every order with our 90-day guarantee.</div></div></div>
      <div class="ln-acc"><div class="ln-acc-hd" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">Isn't red yeast rice basically the same thing as a statin?</div><div class="ln-acc-body"><div class="ln-acc-inner">They share a mechanism — but they're not the same thing. Red yeast rice is a food-derived compound containing multiple monacolins that work together. Prescription statins are isolated, highly concentrated single compounds. Red yeast rice has a gentler effect and a significantly better side effect profile — especially when paired with CoQ10, which is exactly how Lunessa is formulated. That pairing is the difference.</div></div></div>
      <div class="ln-acc"><div class="ln-acc-hd" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">Why does dosing matter so much?</div><div class="ln-acc-body"><div class="ln-acc-inner">Most red yeast rice supplements contain 600mg per serving. Most CoQ10 supplements contain 30–50mg. Clinical research uses 2,400mg of RYR and 200mg+ of CoQ10. If you're taking a supplement at a fraction of the studied dose, you're not replicating what the research showed. Lunessa is formulated at full clinical strength — not marketing math.</div></div></div>
      <div class="ln-acc"><div class="ln-acc-hd" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">Why gummies instead of capsules?</div><div class="ln-acc-body"><div class="ln-acc-inner">The best supplement in the world doesn't work if you don't take it. Capsules get skipped. Large pills get dreaded. Our customers tell us the gummy format turns their daily routine from a chore into something they actually look forward to — and we never compromise on ingredient doses to make it happen.</div></div></div>
      <div class="ln-acc"><div class="ln-acc-hd" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">What about citrinin contamination?</div><div class="ln-acc-body"><div class="ln-acc-inner">Citrinin is a toxic byproduct that can form during fermentation of red yeast rice. It damages kidneys and liver. Many brands don't test for it. Many consumers don't know it exists. Every batch of Lunessa is tested by an independent lab and certified citrinin-free.</div></div></div>
      <div class="ln-acc"><div class="ln-acc-hd" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">What's the dosage?</div><div class="ln-acc-body"><div class="ln-acc-inner">Take 2 gummies daily with your morning meal. Food improves absorption. Do not exceed 2 gummies per day.</div></div></div>
      <div class="ln-acc"><div class="ln-acc-hd" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">What's the guarantee?</div><div class="ln-acc-body"><div class="ln-acc-inner">We back every order with a 90-Day Money-Back Guarantee. If you don't see meaningful improvement within 90 days of consistent use, contact us for a full refund — no return required, no questions asked.</div></div></div>
      <div class="ln-acc"><div class="ln-acc-hd" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">Who should NOT take Lunessa?</div><div class="ln-acc-body"><div class="ln-acc-inner">Lunessa is not recommended for anyone who is pregnant or breastfeeding, anyone with liver disease, anyone currently taking prescription statin medications without physician approval, or anyone under 18.</div></div></div>
